      "changes": [
        {
          "decision": "no_change",
          "reason": "Automatic no-change bookkeeping after genuine sealed generation, independent reviews and post-reveal diagnosis. The analyst proposed no new rule and confirmed the primary stratum; source/review audits report no hard failure. No Skill edit or unperformed retrieval repair is accepted. Original scores, including negative outcomes, are retained. Analyst reason: No skill-text change is justified by this case. Existing instructions already require specialty discovery, representative-paper inspection, authoritative alternative retrieval, bounded repair rounds and source-supported eligibility decisions. The main repair belongs in upstream retrieval and candidate handoff. Supported abstention should be preserved; neither missing evidence nor failure to name the publishing outlet warrants speculative journal rules.",
          "at": "2026-10-02T08:54:14.964490+00:00",
          "files": [],
          "regression_sha256": null
        },
        {
          "decision": "retrieval_repair",
          "reason": "Both actual development cases lacked useful recommendations and the clinical case had ten unverified journal identities. Add the planned public Crossref title/ISSN lookup with identity-only source guards and concentrate on six already discovered dossiers within the same 18 initial + 12 followed endpoint ceiling. Real bounded acquisition regression is recorded. Original negative outcomes are preserved; no improved selection score is claimed.",
